    "Description": "Just got a frantic comm from a ~mission(Ship) that cut out quite dramatically. Seems like they were dumb enough to get lured into a trap, even though I made it damn clear that getting those goods to ~mission(Destination|Address) was all they should worry about.   \n \nWell, it looks like they failed. Trackers hidden in the cargo now show it at ~mission(Location|Address). Time to send in backup to reclaim our goods and teach a lesson to those who took it. You interested in delivering that message then delivering the goods?\n\n- Stows",
